WEBVTT

00:00:06.351 --> 00:00:10.089
(screaming)

00:00:10.122 --> 00:00:12.492
(shouting)

00:00:12.525 --> 00:00:15.060
I've been a bad boy!
我可是个坏小子

00:00:15.094 --> 00:00:16.596
(cackling)
我可是个坏小子

00:00:16.629 --> 00:00:18.330
SOLDIER:
Freeze! Don't move!
-站住 不许动！
-一群超级大傻瓜

00:00:18.363 --> 00:00:19.732
Son of a Betamax!
-站住 不许动！
-一群超级大傻瓜

00:00:19.765 --> 00:00:21.333
-Go! Go! Get him! Get him!
-Go get him!
快 抓住他 他逃跑了 请求支援

00:00:21.366 --> 00:00:23.636
-He's getting away. -Oh!
-(indistinct shouting)
快 抓住他 他逃跑了 请求支援

00:00:23.669 --> 00:00:25.571
This isn't over, Gru.
这事儿没完 格鲁

00:00:25.605 --> 00:00:26.972
You hear me?
听到了吗？这事儿还没完

00:00:27.006 --> 00:00:28.608
This is not over.
听到了吗？这事儿还没完

00:00:28.641 --> 00:00:31.811
Yeah? Well,
I still have the diamond.
是吗？好吧 可惜钻石在我手里

00:00:31.844 --> 00:00:34.413
-(cackling)
-GROUP: *...to you
祝你生日快乐 祝你生日快...

00:00:34.446 --> 00:00:36.649
* Happy birthday...
祝你生日快乐 祝你生日快...

00:00:36.682 --> 00:00:38.083
(noisemaker blowing)
祝你生日快乐 祝你生日快...

00:00:38.117 --> 00:00:40.085
* Happy birthday
（生日快乐 丹）

00:00:40.119 --> 00:00:43.422
-* Dear Dan
-(laughter)
（生日快乐 丹）

00:00:43.455 --> 00:00:48.460
* Happy birthday to you.

00:00:48.494 --> 00:00:50.763
(laughing)

00:00:50.796 --> 00:00:52.932
Hey. (speaking Minionese)

00:00:52.965 --> 00:00:54.934
-Sí. (speaking Minionese)
-(whooping)

00:00:54.967 --> 00:00:58.504
("María" by Ricky Martin
playing)
（沙卡小屋）

00:01:02.542 --> 00:01:04.844
*

00:01:07.046 --> 00:01:09.682
* R.I.P to Nate Dogg,
I had to regulate... *

00:01:09.715 --> 00:01:12.351
-(groaning) -(screaming)
* Watch him disintegrate

00:01:12.384 --> 00:01:15.020
* It's a truckload
coming on the interstate *

00:01:15.054 --> 00:01:17.056
* Sirloin steak
all on my dinner plate... *

00:01:17.089 --> 00:01:18.490
GRU:
Oh!

00:01:18.524 --> 00:01:20.793
I can't believe
Bratt got away again.
真不敢相信 布莱特那家伙又跑了

00:01:20.826 --> 00:01:23.529
How is this possible? How?
你说这怎么可能呢？说啊

00:01:23.563 --> 00:01:26.031
* Broke... I can never
get along with them *

00:01:26.065 --> 00:01:28.901
* Always been hated
since a little... *

00:01:28.934 --> 00:01:31.303
-(man grunts, music stops)
-(Gru laughs)

00:01:31.336 --> 00:01:32.838
-And it's not just that
he got away. -(camera clicks)
那家伙不仅逃跑了
还那么得意洋洋的

00:01:32.872 --> 00:01:35.240
It is he's so smug about it.
那家伙不仅逃跑了
还那么得意洋洋的

00:01:35.274 --> 00:01:38.410
(mockingly):
"Ooh, I've been a bad boy!"
“我可是个坏小子”

00:01:38.443 --> 00:01:40.145
-Gah!
-Edna, hey!
埃娜 你今天很漂亮

00:01:40.179 --> 00:01:42.314
-(cats mewing)
-Looking hot... today.
埃娜 你今天很漂亮

00:01:42.347 --> 00:01:44.349
Got, uh, cats on you.
戴了...戴了顶帽子

00:01:44.383 --> 00:01:46.586
And it was so humiliating,
而且他还让我丢了大脸

00:01:46.619 --> 00:01:48.253
dangling there
in the bubble-gum Speedo.
害得我穿着泡泡糖泳裤挂在天上

00:01:48.287 --> 00:01:50.055
* Watch, this is
so fun to see... *
害得我穿着泡泡糖泳裤挂在天上

00:01:50.089 --> 00:01:52.491
And I didn't have time
to go to the gym this week,
我这个星期没找到时间去健身房

00:01:52.524 --> 00:01:55.561
-* Uh, despicable me...
-and I had a big breakfast.
而且 之前我早饭吃多了

00:01:55.595 --> 00:01:57.429
-And was feeling
a little bloated. -(mewing)
所以 就觉得有点儿胃胀

00:01:57.462 --> 00:01:59.699
-(whirring)
-You know what?
你知道吗 他就不值得我浪费口水

00:01:59.732 --> 00:02:02.334
He's not even worth
talking about. I don't even
你知道吗 他就不值得我浪费口水

00:02:02.367 --> 00:02:04.503
want to waste another breath
about the guy.
都不想浪费在那家伙身上

00:02:04.536 --> 00:02:08.107
-* I'm having a bad, bad
day... * -And another thing!
还有一件事

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:10.509
Next time I see Bratt,
I will moonwalk
下次再见到布莱特 我发誓我要

00:02:10.542 --> 00:02:12.177
-all over his stupid face!
-(mewing)
踩着他的臭脸跳舞

00:02:12.211 --> 00:02:14.346
-Dah, ta-ta, ta-ta,
ta-ah, ta-tah! -* Ah
（反恶人联盟）

00:02:14.379 --> 00:02:16.749
-* Despicable me.
-Bah-bah-bah, bah-bah-bah, bah.
（反恶人联盟）

00:02:16.782 --> 00:02:20.419
Thank you all for coming
at such short notice.
感谢大家在这么短的时间内赶了过来

00:02:20.452 --> 00:02:23.388
It is with great sadness
在这里 我非常悲伤

00:02:23.422 --> 00:02:26.025
that I inform you
that, as of today,
也非常不舍地通知大家

00:02:26.058 --> 00:02:29.929
I am retiring
as head of the AVL.
我将从联盟负责人的位子上退下来

00:02:29.962 --> 00:02:31.530
(people gasping, indistinct,
overlapping chatter)
什么？他要退休？

00:02:31.563 --> 00:02:33.232
Oh, no.
不

00:02:33.265 --> 00:02:36.602
Your new leader
is coming directly
我们联盟总部

00:02:36.636 --> 00:02:40.706
from head office,
effective immediately.
她的任命立即生效

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:43.876
She is the very gifted,
她拥有超凡的天赋以及雄心壮志

00:02:43.909 --> 00:02:48.580
very ambitious,
Miss Valerie da Vinci.
她拥有超凡的天赋以及雄心壮志

00:02:48.614 --> 00:02:52.317
As I look out
over all your faces,
我站在这里看着在座的各位同事

00:02:52.351 --> 00:02:54.586
I am flooded
with so many memories.
忍不住想起了一起工作的日子...

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:57.289
-Oh, boy!
This is a snooze fest! -Uh...
够啦 别浪费时间废话了

00:02:57.322 --> 00:02:58.791
E-Excuse me.
This is my last...
不好意思 这是我最后...

00:02:58.824 --> 00:03:00.292
Blah, blah, blah!
We understand. You're old,
唧唧歪歪的 我们懂了

00:03:00.325 --> 00:03:02.061
-you're fat, you're done.
-(muttering) Oh.
你老了 你胖了 你完了

00:03:02.094 --> 00:03:04.096
-Ooh. (groans loudly)
-Let me breathe in.
让我喘口气

00:03:04.129 --> 00:03:05.831
(echoing): Oh.

00:03:05.865 --> 00:03:08.934
Ooh, broke a little sweat
there. (laughs)
出了一点点汗

00:03:08.968 --> 00:03:11.303
First order of business.
(clears her throat)
我们先说第一件事

00:03:11.336 --> 00:03:14.840
Which one of you losers
is Agent Gru?!
你们当中哪个衰蛋是格鲁探员？

00:03:14.874 --> 00:03:17.476
Oh, that would be me.
你说的是我

00:03:17.509 --> 00:03:20.813
Although, I don't know
if I'd say "loser," per se.
但是对于“衰蛋”这个说法
我不太同意

00:03:20.846 --> 00:03:22.281
-Kind of is...
-(phone ringing)
但是对于“衰蛋”这个说法
我不太同意

00:03:22.314 --> 00:03:25.184
(gasps, groans)
感觉有点儿...

00:03:25.217 --> 00:03:26.919
Oh, it's the girls.
是我的女儿们 老爸在开会

00:03:26.952 --> 00:03:29.288
Not a good time.
（女儿们）

00:03:29.321 --> 00:03:30.690
-Hey!
-(screams)

00:03:30.723 --> 00:03:32.124
Yes, sir! (gasps)
是 先生...女士

00:03:32.157 --> 00:03:33.525
Uh... ma'am?
是 先生...女士

00:03:33.558 --> 00:03:35.094
You're making me nervous.
你这样我很紧张

00:03:35.127 --> 00:03:37.997
How could you let
Balthazar Bratt,
你怎么可以让巴特扎布莱特

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:41.701
the AVL's most wanted villain,
just get away?
反恶人联盟头号通缉犯就那么跑了？

00:03:41.734 --> 00:03:44.169
That is the opposite
of what we do here!
我们是抓坏蛋不是放坏蛋的

00:03:44.203 --> 00:03:48.373
Okay, okay.
Yes, maybe he got away. Again.
好吧 没错 他确实又跑了 确实

00:03:48.407 --> 00:03:50.943
But he didn't get
the diamond.
但是他没拿到钻石

00:03:50.976 --> 00:03:54.046
And I am this close
to bringing him in.
而我就差一点儿 就抓住他了

00:03:54.079 --> 00:03:56.548
This close.
就差一点儿

00:03:56.581 --> 00:03:58.283
Huh. Interesting.
-真有意思 你被开除了！
-什么？

00:03:58.317 --> 00:03:59.685
You're fired!
-真有意思 你被开除了！
-什么？

00:03:59.719 --> 00:04:02.054
-(gasps) What?
-That's totally not fair.
-真有意思 你被开除了！
-什么？

00:04:02.087 --> 00:04:04.223
Gru is a great agent!
You know what?
这太不讲道理了 格鲁他做得非常好

00:04:04.256 --> 00:04:07.693
If you fire him, you're gonna
have to fire me, sister-sister.
那把我也开除好了 新来的大姐

00:04:07.727 --> 00:04:11.496
And do you really
want to do that? Do ya?
你真的想那样做吗？想吗？

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:13.465
-No, no, no, no, no, Hey!
-(both yelling)
不

00:04:13.498 --> 00:04:16.368
(yelling continues)

00:04:16.401 --> 00:04:18.070
(Gru groans, Lucy groans)

00:04:18.103 --> 00:04:20.505
-(Gru groans)
-Well, I guess she did.
看来她真想

00:04:20.539 --> 00:04:21.874
(Gru groaning)

00:04:25.878 --> 00:04:27.847
GRU: Honey, you didn't have
to do that.
亲爱的 你其实不用那么做
我知道你多爱这份工作

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:30.015
I know how much
you love your job.
亲爱的 你其实不用那么做
我知道你多爱这份工作

00:04:30.049 --> 00:04:32.918
Well, I love
other things more.
好吧 比起工作我更爱别的

00:04:35.587 --> 00:04:37.823
You know, we're gonna
have to tell the girls.
对了 得把这件事告诉女儿们

00:04:37.857 --> 00:04:39.825
Can you do it?
你来说好吗？

00:04:39.859 --> 00:04:42.427
The whole mom thing
is still kind of new to me.
我还是不太清楚怎么给人当妈妈

00:04:42.461 --> 00:04:44.229
Oh, sure.
好的

00:04:44.263 --> 00:04:46.031
(door squeaks open)

00:04:46.065 --> 00:04:47.366
Huh?

00:04:47.399 --> 00:04:49.034
Psst. (clicks his tongue)

00:04:49.068 --> 00:04:50.936
(exhales, trills,
makes popping sounds)

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.272
(hooting like an owl)

00:04:53.305 --> 00:04:55.841
-(wind whips)
-(musical sputtering)

00:04:55.875 --> 00:04:58.510
-Ah! (muttering gibberish)
-Yah!

00:04:58.543 --> 00:05:00.245
Hello?
有人吗？

00:05:00.279 --> 00:05:03.215
-Yah!
-(gasps) Oh, no!

00:05:03.248 --> 00:05:05.084
(Lucy groaning)

00:05:05.117 --> 00:05:07.286
(Lucy and Gru groaning)

00:05:07.319 --> 00:05:10.189
-Aah! (groans)
-(girls giggling)

00:05:10.222 --> 00:05:11.690
-(growling)
-AGNES AND MARGO: Aloha!
（夏威夷语）你们好！

00:05:11.723 --> 00:05:15.127
-(giggling)
-Oh.
（你们好）

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.362
This is unexpected.
还真是...没想到啊

00:05:17.396 --> 00:05:19.899
Well, you never got
to go on a honeymoon, so...
好吧 你们都没去度蜜月 所以...

00:05:19.932 --> 00:05:21.300
We made you dinner!
-我们做了晚饭
-一顿大餐

00:05:21.333 --> 00:05:22.802
It's a luau!
-我们做了晚饭
-一顿大餐

00:05:22.835 --> 00:05:25.437
We got pineapples
and coconuts and ukuleles!
我们准备了菠萝 椰子和尤克里里琴

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:27.472
-Oh. Yay!
-Yay!

00:05:27.506 --> 00:05:31.476
* Hey!
(singing in Minionese)

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:33.478
-* Ooh... -* Ow, ow,
ah-ah-ah-ah-ah-ah, oh *

00:05:33.512 --> 00:05:35.380
* Ow, ow,
ah-ah-ah-ah-ah-ah, oh *

00:05:35.414 --> 00:05:37.216
* Oh, ti, tiki,
ti-tiki, ti *

00:05:37.249 --> 00:05:38.617
(singing in Minionese)
* Babalu.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:40.419
(singing
in Minionese continues)

00:05:40.452 --> 00:05:43.488
(clears her throat)
The soup of the day.
这是今天的汤

00:05:43.522 --> 00:05:45.390
Madame and monsieur.
这位夫人 还有先生

00:05:45.424 --> 00:05:47.259
The gummy bears were my idea.
小熊软糖是我的主意

00:05:47.292 --> 00:05:49.628
(singing continues)
小熊软糖是我的主意

00:05:49.661 --> 00:05:52.264
GRU:
Mmm!

00:05:52.297 --> 00:05:55.067
Looks too good to even eat.
这么漂亮我都舍不得吃了
是不是呀？

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:57.169
Am I right? (laughs)
这么漂亮我都舍不得吃了
是不是呀？

00:05:57.202 --> 00:05:59.004
But I made it for you.
我特地给你做的

00:05:59.038 --> 00:06:01.506
Oh.

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.909
Mm! Mmm, mmm, mmm!
真好喝

00:06:03.943 --> 00:06:06.611
Good soup!
I love the combination...
我超喜欢小熊软糖和肉
放一起煮的味道

00:06:06.645 --> 00:06:08.013
(swallows)
我超喜欢小熊软糖和肉
放一起煮的味道

00:06:08.047 --> 00:06:11.250
...of gummy bears
and meat.
我超喜欢小熊软糖和肉
放一起煮的味道

00:06:11.283 --> 00:06:14.153
(singing continues
in the distance)

00:06:14.186 --> 00:06:16.521
Mm. Mm.

00:06:16.555 --> 00:06:18.290
I'm gonna hold it
in my mouth.
我要把汤含在嘴里

00:06:18.323 --> 00:06:20.325
'Cause it's so good,
I don't want to swallow it.
因为好喝得我不想咽下去

00:06:20.359 --> 00:06:21.793
So, how was work?
对了 工作顺利吗？

00:06:21.827 --> 00:06:23.628
Ooh, did you
take that guy down?
打败那个坏蛋了吗？

00:06:23.662 --> 00:06:25.464
Did anything explode?
是不是有东西爆炸了？

00:06:25.497 --> 00:06:28.533
Well, actually, today...
好吧 是这样的

00:06:28.567 --> 00:06:31.270
Lucy and I were invited
今天新来的领导
建议我和露西换个工作

00:06:31.303 --> 00:06:34.940
to not work
at the AVL anymore.
离开反恶人联盟

00:06:34.974 --> 00:06:37.309
-(plays discordant note)
-(mutters) -(gasps) No!

00:06:39.344 --> 00:06:40.812
You got fired?
-你们被炒了？
-才不是

00:06:40.846 --> 00:06:42.781
Oh, no! No, no, no,
no, no, no.
-你们被炒了？
-才不是

00:06:42.814 --> 00:06:44.183
(Gru chuckles)

00:06:44.216 --> 00:06:45.885
-Yes.
-Wha...?
-是的
-什么？

00:06:45.918 --> 00:06:47.719
But don't worry.
但是 不用担心
我们会很快找到新工作的

00:06:47.752 --> 00:06:50.322
I-I'm sure
we'll get new jobs real soon.
但是 不用担心
我们会很快找到新工作的

00:06:50.355 --> 00:06:51.891
Even better ones.
更好的工作

00:06:51.924 --> 00:06:53.525
(scoffs)
What's better
什么工作能比得上
超级酷的秘密特工？

00:06:53.558 --> 00:06:55.827
than being supercool
secret agents?
什么工作能比得上
超级酷的秘密特工？

